2
00:00:03,809 --> 00:00:08,060
What an inspiring picture!

3
00:00:08,069 --> 00:00:13,310
A cluster of people are playing rope-skipping together, keeping in step.

4
00:00:13,319 --> 00:00:16,810
Two men swaying the rope on each side are counting.

5
00:00:16,819 --> 00:00:19,000
On careful observation,

6
00:00:19,009 --> 00:00:22,390
we may discover that one of them counts to ninety-nine,

7
00:00:22,399 --> 00:00:24,730
while the other one hundred.

8
00:00:24,739 --> 00:00:28,550
It seems to me that the painter intends to point out that

9
00:00:28,559 --> 00:00:33,910
the construction of a harmonious society demands our joint effort and that

10
00:00:33,919 --> 00:00:37,850
there may be phenomena that disrupt our social harmony.

11
00:00:37,859 --> 00:00:42,670
Although it is by no means a simple task to build a society

12
00:00:42,679 --> 00:00:46,600
in which people live in harmony with each other and with the nature,

13
00:00:46,609 --> 00:00:50,320
we are confident that if everyone contributes to the cause,

14
00:00:50,329 --> 00:00:52,720
many hands will make light work.

15
00:00:52,729 --> 00:00:58,630
At the same time, it would be unlikely to realize our long-term development goals

16
00:00:58,639 --> 00:01:02,560
unless we remain conscious of some widespread problems.

17
00:01:02,569 --> 00:01:05,180
There is no denying that we are confronted with

18
00:01:05,189 --> 00:01:10,220
increasingly acute social unrest resulting from growing disparity

19
00:01:10,229 --> 00:01:14,010
between developed coastal area and underdeveloped west,

20
00:01:14,019 --> 00:01:17,080
widening gap of the wealthy and the poor,

21
00:01:17,089 --> 00:01:20,360
environment pollution and government corruption.

22
00:01:20,369 --> 00:01:25,500
Since a disharmonious society is not liable to survive hard times,

23
00:01:25,509 --> 00:01:30,640
it is of great significance that we make concerted effort to eliminate problems

24
00:01:30,649 --> 00:01:32,640
and establish a harmonious and prosperous society.

